# Protect secrets

Never read, search, print, quote, or commit real env/credential files.

Blocked: `.env`, `.env.*`, `.envrc`, `.env.vault`, `*.env`, `*.pem`, `*.key`, `credentials.json`, `secrets.json`, `service-account*.json`.

Allowed: `.env.example`, `.env.template`, `.env.production.example` (placeholders only).

If a secret is needed, tell the user to set it in Azure/GitHub Secrets or a local untracked `.env`. Do not invent, copy, or paste secret values.
